WEBVTT

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.150
Every time I watch it, it's still horrible.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:46.850
If used as a weapon, yeah.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:51.160
Ever since the days of Doctor Nobel, science is all in how you use it.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:54.490
You guys seem pretty preoccupied, huh?

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:58.500
Are records of the First Limited War all that interesting?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.670
Y- yes!

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.030
We were just verifying the effectiveness of the planetary destruction weapons,

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.840
like the Geo Sort bomb!

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:07.670
What sort of outdated nonsense are you talking about?

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:10.840
In your duties now, it is a planetary restructuring tool, right?

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:13.980
Yes! We will call up the data

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.520
on where all of the Geo Sorts are presently located right away!

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:21.040
<i>Good grief, they're so quick to loaf around!</i>

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:31.130
Terraforming? Planetary restructuring?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.900
No. It's the same kind of thing,

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.470
but this is a planet that a Geo Sort bomb was used on.

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:39.810
Ah, I've seen them during history time.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:42.480
As I recall, that was 200 years or so ago...

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.930
That's a current, real-time image, isn't it?

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:52.310
Yes. And Planet Atoth must have had many people still living on it.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.060
You knew that there were deposits of the quantum suppression material E-III

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:59.490
confirmed on Atoth last spring, right?

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.830
You don't mean!

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:04.160
So you're saying that there were companies exploiting the E-III resources?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.200
A number of organizations did this, in order to buy out those companies,

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.840
together with those inhabitants that would not leave.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:14.040
This incident is already being investigated

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.910
by another organization within the Globe-governments Union.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.180
I heard that going around with your face uncovered

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:23.180
was the convention for ES members of GOTT,

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.170
but that is the height of foolishness!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:29.760
We at GOTT are responsible for the possession and distribution

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.420
of all of the Geo Sort bombs in the galaxy.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.460
In other words, the one that was used on Atoth...

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:39.300
...was acquired through a backroom deal, huh?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.470
l- I didn't have anything to do with it, of course!

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:48.110
Éclair, Lumiere, you two please determine the distribution route it took,

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.140
and stop it.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.370
We accept this special assignment!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:10.460
What do you think, Miss, having seen it firsthand?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.070
The lady is most impressed, both in our galaxy,

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:21.510
and the energy development systems that support its civilizations...

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.180
as well as in your unfaltering explanation.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.510
Oh, my...

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:31.450
She is quite problematic. As her tutor, there's nothing for me to do.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.150
Not at all!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.790
A- and while we're talking about energy development systems,

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:41.030
it's E-I through E-IV as well as other various energy acquisition systems,

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:43.130
that this government office directs and supervises.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.830
Even now, each of our laboratories

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.800
has started work on developing next-generation energy systems.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:52.470
E-dash-eight dimensional gravity folding system small-scale stabilization,

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:57.080
and scalartakers from Planck hyperspaces are currently our strongest candidates

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.140
for E-V.

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:59.480
In order for materialization and propagation in these early stages...

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:00.480
Well?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.820
This is very enjoyable.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:08.410
Right now I'm having the 3028th and final firewall let me through.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:18.920
I kind of wish they would follow GOTT's example of logical firewalls.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.870
What's that?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.240
An interceptor? No, it looks like someone got here before me.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:43.560
An Ace-I class cracker, eh? Someone else in the trade, I wonder.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:46.130
Oh, you're Lumiere!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.850
<i>Tweedledee-san!</i>

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.870
Then, we were both ordered separately by Chief Eclipse

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.140
to the same special assignment?

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:58.470
So it would seem.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.140
Though there is nothing I am more averse to.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:03.480
Tweedledum, you've said too much.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.140
Pardon me.

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:08.150
Does that mean we aren't trusted by the chief?

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.150
Your skills, you mean?

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:12.150
Or perhaps your humanity?

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:15.820
Humanity? You're the last one I want to hear from about that!

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:21.490
Anyhow, since we're all GOTT members, we should all work together.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:23.290
You're right.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.500
I do wish to be of service to you, sister,

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.110
even if it's no more than being a decoy.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.110
'Dledum!

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:37.440
Pardon me.

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.110
Well then, shall we get started?

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.170
Could you wait for just a moment?

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.120
What's that?

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.790
Ah, this is like an invocation for her.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.720
She says it's grape juice.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:57.190
Thanks for waiting. Well now, shall we get going?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.770
You're using the classic tools, huh?

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:38.830
However...

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.780
This way is easier for retrieving things from the galactic network.

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:47.450
A virtual sphere?

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.450
You have fine taste, don't you?

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:54.790
Thanks. Where's the data we borrowed from the energy development systems?

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.460
I have it compressed.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.580
Okay, I'll be borrowing it for a little bit.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.060
This is incredibly heavy, huh?

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:12.590
Now then, shall we go round-robin, in order of highest priority?

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:21.010
Typically,

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.480
top-secret data is converted to quantized random numbers while on the network,

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.790
and tracking them down is a difficult task.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.820
Or I should probably say, a contest of endurance.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:32.420
Actually, I don't mind playing tag.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.430
Wow, how cute!

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:42.070
Our search parameters center around Geo Sort bombs

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:43.440
and planetary restructuring,

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:47.540
with related items anywhere, with an inference depth of D-5.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:51.440
Refer to the data from earlier for priority ranking. All right?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.500
Yes!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.820
One after another,

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.130
they create replicas of themselves, and they do simultaneous searches.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.790
It sure is an interesting tool.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:10.460
Shall I make a copy for you?

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:15.300
That's okay. Once I see a tool, I can usually create it myself.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.140
Wow...

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:22.870
Shall we hurry things along with some parallel processing?

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.810
These are the Geo-Sort bomb distribution routes

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:31.080
and coordinates of the weapons arsenals, right?

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:33.890
I can hardly believe it.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.620
Even with the latest hardware at the Office of the Peace,

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:36.420
I couldn't find it this quickly.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:39.430
You don't have to push yourself too hard to believe it.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.860
It's just...

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:44.130
...I don't think it would hurt you to remember

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.430
that when it comes to the abilities of ES members,

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.770
1 plus 1 doesn't add up to 2.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.970
I believe it, and I will remember it.

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:56.440
It's just that when I think of that power being misused, it gives me the chills.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:10:00.780
I can't speak for her, but my sister does no evil.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.180
Do you not know why wars happen?

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:07.520
It's because justice only exists in the number of people there are.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:16.130
After transferring distribution routes to GOTT Headquarters,

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:21.070
C-Squared and La Muse rushing to said weapons arsenal coordinates.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:44.090
Move it! Once you've loaded all you can load, get it out of here!

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.430
The data and the goods have top priority!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:50.760
Use any container you can find! Don't forget that control core!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.770
What could be going on? It looks like they're in a hurry.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.430
There's going to be a raid by GOTT!

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.560
What!?

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:01.770
The stealth shield is up! There's no way they could hear me, you know.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:05.110
The shield isn't of any use against your raised voice.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.450
But still, this is all too soon!

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.410
There has to be an information leak!

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:15.220
Chief, under our authority as GOTT ES members,

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:18.590
we urgently request authorization to execute an arrest.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.400
Chief? Chief!?

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.410
The line isn't going through, huh?

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.240
<i>This can't be...</i>

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.190
Chief?

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:27.530
Whatever happened to knocking?

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.390
l- I did...

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:34.020
More importantly, Chief, there's a request from Éclair to execute an arrest.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:41.140
I know. Step back.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.570
Chief!

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:51.940
Step back, Mercredi.

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.550
I beg your pardon.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:04.500
Yes, this is the chief's office.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:05.430
Yes...

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:08.660
Yes, that's right.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:15.840
Yes, I have dealt with it like you said.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.510
<i>There weren't any problems?</i>

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:21.180
There were, but they were slight. It is nothing for you to worry about.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.850
<i>Please be sure you keep this to yourself.</i>

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:27.250
Of course. I understand completely.

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:32.120
We can't wait for the Chief's authorization any longer!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.530
If we don't stop them quick,

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.860
this place will be emptied before the reinforcements get here!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.470
I wonder, is her ability "Recklessness?"

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.730
Something along those lines.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:52.140
My, my...

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:56.170
It appears that the lady has started, all right.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.610
Indeed, the lady does such severe things.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.160
Dammit!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.790
Take this!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.170
Remember, 'Dledum,

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:19.170
this is all material evidence,

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:24.180
so keep them in their current state as much as possible, okay?

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.300
I know, sister.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:37.990
Still, I doubt there's much I can do about this one.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:47.130
Forgive me, sister. I was unable to follow your instructions.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.470
<i>Don't call me sister while we're on special assignment!</i>

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.140
Right, 'Dledee!

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:54.070
Aw, what a waste!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.850
W- what is this!? The ship is moving on its own!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.690
A genetic beast!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.600
<i>My shield energy is already used up!</i>

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.780
Ta-da~a!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.450
Éclair!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.450
If this were Little Red Riding Hood,

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.390
then I guess I would be the hunter, right?

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:44.790
What?

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.760
The transport ships!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.810
Are you awake?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.140
Where are we?

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:04.270
I don't know. We ran out of there so quickly...

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.150
Thanks.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.150
Even so, aren't those brother and sister taking things too far?

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.220
No, the people here must have given up on escaping,

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.920
and have chosen to destroy the evidence instead. We must hurry.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.830
<i>Good grief, what a foolish bunch!</i>

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.500
Tweedledee?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.400
<i>We've secured the targets we were after,</i>

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:28.460
<i>and placed restrictions upon the surrounding area, but...</i>

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.770
Sure enough, they've used them, haven't they?

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.440
What do you mean?

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:37.470
<i>These folks have engaged a Geo Sort bomb.</i>

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:43.450
Right now, we're doing what we can to hold the Geo Sort bomb in, but...

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:44.780
Tweedledee!

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:47.450
<i>Tweedledee-san!</i>

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:50.360
<i>I'm terribly sorry, but it doesn't look like we're going to be able</i>

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.790
<i>to completely hold this thing down with our own abilities.</i>

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.790
<i>Go on and escape with the targets ahead of us.</i>

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.790
<i>Tweedledee-san!</i>

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:59.030
<i>Right now you are C-class ES members.</i>

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>You have a duty to follow what your superior-ranking members tell you to do,</i>

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.460
<i>right?</i>

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.800
<i>You know the coordinates of the targets, right?</i>

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:12.240
<i>Lumiere, I wish I could have become a closer acquaintance of yours.</i>

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.150
Lumiere! Éclair!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:23.020
Sister, no! You can't get distracted!

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:49.210
If only Cesario and Viola were here!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.980
Their ability interferes with intermolecular forces too,

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.450
just like the Geo Sort bomb, right?

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:57.120
If they were here, they could nullify this thing in no time!

00:17:57.120 --> 00:18:01.860
A man nagging his sister for something she doesn't have? How unbecoming!

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.130
Éclair! Lumiere!

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:07.470
What are you doing here? What about the targets?

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:10.640
We packed both the suspects and the evidence onto a high speed ship

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:11.470
and sent it off!

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:15.140
With a specially-written automated program from Lumiere, of course.

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:18.810
Why didn't you escape with them!? You guys coming here isn't going to...

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:22.040
They were simply showing us the way. Don't mind them.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.850
Alv!

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.090
This is quite a mess you've made here.

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:33.990
Thanks to you, our job is never done.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.700
What's the matter? Hurry up and move away.

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.770
Or do you guys want to get absorbed as well?

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:43.770
You don't have to tell us! Let's go, 'Dledum!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.440
You've got it, sister!

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.630
1... 2... 3!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.480
Wow, this is!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:07.890
I see, so this is what a Geo Sort - resonance-site transcript propagation-

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:08.930
does, is it!?

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:11.920
Fascinating! Fascinating!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:23.540
So this is "Absorb," the assimilation of all forces.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:36.090
What is your duty here?

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:39.420
To collect and secure any object that might be evidence!

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:42.450
Very good. Now get to it!

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.430
You have... my gratitude.

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.870
Don't worry about it.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:52.600
Covering for those who lack enough power is our job as fellow workers.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.130
Besides, we owed you one.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:00.110
Chief, our special assignment is complete.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:03.110
We'll be returning now.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:10.350
Dvergr, Alv, well done. I look forward to your safe return.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:17.190
<i>Why? After all we went through earlier...</i>

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:50.430
Chief, if possible, please do not double-cross her.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:54.270
I fully realize how presumptuous it is for me to say that.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.430
It's you we're talking about.

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:57.770
I'm sure you must have some kind of idea...

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.770
Auditor...

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:02.600
This is something you don't need to know about.

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:09.240
<i>Secretly it creeps up.</i>

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:12.540
<i>From behind the prey, it displays a kind face.</i>

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:15.550
<i>By the time it realizes, it's already too late...</i>

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:19.950
<i>Next time on Kiddy Grade</i>
